			"Message": "docs(Air): Sync CHANGELOG with improved formatting and structure\n\nSubmodule synchronization bringing Air to e79de101. The CHANGELOG.md receives improved markdown formatting: expanded header describing Air's background daemon sidecar role, reformatted v2.1 section with proper list syntax and subsystem tags, reorganized v2.0 module inventory into categorized bullet points, and consolidated dependency section with inline formatting.\n\nThis aligns Air's documentation with the prose-style CHANGELOG format established across other Land components, improving onboarding context for contributors.",
